From 620196ce1b867b43f14527ac71648d91f8cc5da7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:52:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Add infinite TMs, Smart Repel loop and solo trade
 evolutions

Infinite TMs: teaching a TM no longer removes it from the bag. In the TM
Case, TMs behave like HMs: no quantity shown, can't be held or sold.

Smart Repel loop: when a Repel wears off, EventScript_RepelWoreOff calls
the new GetRepelToReuse special (prefers the kind used last, stored in
VAR_LAST_REPEL_USED, the unused VAR_0x40A0) and asks "Would you like to
use another REPEL?". Saying YES uses it via UseRepelToReuse.

Solo evolutions: Kadabra, Machoke, Graveler and Haunter evolve at level
40. Former trade-with-item evolutions (Politoed, Slowking, Steelix,
Scizor, Kingdra, Porygon2, Huntail, Gorebyss) now happen by using the
item from the bag like an evolution stone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDbdFFZUtxJmCbg3V6KwVM
